.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt PATH_IS_ABSOLUTE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm path_is_absolute
.Nd check if a path is absolute
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In path.h
.Ft int
.Fn path_is_absolute "const char *p"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn path_is_absolute
function tests whether the path string
.Fa p
is an absolute pathname (e.g., starting with a slash or drive letter).
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero if the path is absolute, or 0 if it is relative.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr path_absolute 3